34. **`MazeFanoutDiagnostics` holds an `AutorouteControl` reference**, so `MazeSearchAlgo::set_control()` must destroy and recreate it — a dangling control reference otherwise crashes as soon as the control is replaced. Its `enabled()` gate is a `fanout_start_pin_name` prefix (`U27-`), so fanout traces only appear for that naming pattern (Java parity, not a bug).
"""
assert anchor in s
